  "summary": "How to run Dana Whitfield's desk at Example Holdings. Priya left on 25 September and Marcus started on 5 October, so there was no overlap: Dana held the desk in between. Start with the path for your first weeks, keep the daily list open, and check **Needs attention** every morning.",
