    "hours": "Weekdays 8:00 to 5:00, with some evening events",
    "travel": "Rarely: Dana travels, and the desk runs from the office",
    "manages": "No direct reports. Books the company driver for Dana",
    "skills": "- Running a senior executive's diary, inbox and travel\n- Discretion with board papers and personal information\n- Accurate expense claims and card reconciliations\n- Clear, polite writing to board members and outside guests",
    "measures": "- Expense claims reach Finance by Thursday noon every week\n- Board packs go out through the portal on time, never by email\n- Dana agrees the next week's diary every Friday"
